{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">姜麗文（Lesley）向來孝順又有愛心，與爸爸秦沛感情極之深厚。日前，姜麗文於社交平台大晒與秦沛在加拿大生活的溫馨日常，表達對爸爸的無限愛意。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"33736356-b137-4eec-b7f0-3278405d17a2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026T2CDuE53lu1790932968.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"33736356-b137-4eec-b7f0-3278405d17a2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中可見，81歲的秦沛依然精神爽利。父女二人不僅在海邊相擁合照、在滿地楓葉的步道上留下腳印，更一齊歎美食、打麻雀，盡情享受天倫之樂。其中一段影片中，秦沛更跟隨音樂節奏揮動雙手翩翩起舞，相當精靈有活力！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"982198a9-a453-4de2-80fb-5d22466df85c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20261CVHvh4OHo1790932967.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"982198a9-a453-4de2-80fb-5d22466df85c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">姜麗文對爸爸的愛意溢於言表，每一張照片都附上感性又溫馨的留言，例如「感恩 🙏🏻 珍惜 ✨ 幸福 ❤️」、「An 81 year young boy 😄」、「Remember to say I LOVE YOU! 💖」、「Daddy looks handsome」等。姜麗文更全程緊緊攬實爸爸，時而獻吻時而貼面甜笑，畫面極之治癒。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">照片及影片曝光後，大批圈中好友及網民亦紛紛洗版留言讚好，直指秦沛「狀態好好」、「81歲依然咁精靈」，並感嘆「父女感情真係好到令人羨慕！」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T09:58:12.643767+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":407,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}